      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Buck Steiner opened Capitol Saddlery in 1930, a leather shop that still stands today just a stone’s throw from the Texas Capitol.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://laketravislifestyle.com/lake-travis-area-history-steiner-ranch/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Proceeds from Buck’s saddlery later funded the purchase of the land that would become Steiner Ranch.",
